"
Can you output the evolution milestones of Chinese high‑speed rail (focus on the Beijing‑Shanghai corridor) as a pseudo‑code snippet, e.g., `// Chinese HSR timeline
milestones = [];
if year >= 2007 then milestones.append('Beijing‑Shanghai line inaugurated');
if year == 2011 then milestones.append('Speed upgraded to 350 km/h');
if year == 2016 then milestones.append('Introduction of Fuxing EMU');
...`?"

